gov:StatutoryGovernanceAppointment
    a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme gov:governanceTaxonomy ;
    skos:prefLabel "Statutory governance appointment"@en ;
    skos:definition "A governance position constituted under a statute governing maintained schools - the School Governance (Constitution) (England) Regulations 2012 (SI 2012/1034) or the School Governance (Roles, Procedures and Allowances) (England) Regulations 2013 (SI 2013/1624) - usually unpaid, per the \"usually unpaid governance roles\" evidence in academy-trust-governance-real-world-rules.md. See gov:DelegatedGovernanceAppointment for the equivalent Academy Trust basis."@en ;
    skos:broader gov:AppointmentBasis ;
    skos:related gov:DelegatedGovernanceAppointment ;
    gov:status "Provisional"@en .

gov:DelegatedGovernanceAppointment
    a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme gov:governanceTaxonomy ;
    skos:prefLabel "Delegated governance appointment"@en ;
    skos:definition "A governance position held under an organisation's own non-statutory governing constitution, rather than under a statute governing maintained schools - an Academy Trust's Articles of Association and scheme of delegation, or equally an independent school's own historic charitable governing constitution. Usually unpaid, on the same \"usually unpaid governance roles\" evidence in academy-trust-governance-real-world-rules.md as gov:StatutoryGovernanceAppointment, differing only in the source of authority."@en ;
    skos:broader gov:AppointmentBasis ;
    skos:related gov:StatutoryGovernanceAppointment ;
    gov:status "Provisional"@en .

gov:OperationalEmploymentRole
    a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme gov:governanceTaxonomy ;
    skos:prefLabel "Operational employment role"@en ;
    skos:definition "A paid operational or executive position at the trust or school, not itself a governance appointment even where the same person may separately hold one, per the \"typically paid operational roles\" evidence in academy-trust-governance-real-world-rules.md."@en ;
    skos:broader gov:AppointmentBasis ;
    gov:status "Provisional"@en .

gov:ProfessionalSupportRole
    a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme gov:governanceTaxonomy ;
    skos:prefLabel "Professional support role"@en ;
    skos:definition "A professional role that supports governance administration or compliance, provided either by a trust employee or an external/contracted professional, per the \"typically paid, but employment arrangement can vary\" evidence in academy-trust-governance-real-world-rules.md."@en ;
    skos:broader gov:AppointmentBasis ;
    gov:status "Provisional"@en .
